    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061127.0069\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 27 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nURGENT: Hill arrives in Beijing for Korean Peninsular nuclear talks\n\n\n\n\nThe U.S. Assistant Secretary of State Christopher Hill arrived here Monday afternoon to continue efforts on resuming the six-party talks on the Korean Peninsular nuclear issue.\n\nJust a week ago, Hill came to the Chinese capital and met with vice foreign minister Wu Dawei. The two agreed to make joint efforts for the restart of the talks.",
